	/// RDEL, RDEL_EX_DEPN, CDEL, RAME, CAME, ADMIN, ADMIN_EX_DEPN, NON_DEPT_AME, NON_BUDGET or UNCLASSIFIED. The measures overlap by design: never add them.
	column 'Plan Measure'
